# Build artifacts
build/
build-*/
dist/
# 5WHY (simplify 2026-09-04): qmllint/qmlcachegen 在源码旁生成 .qmlc 编译
# 缓存（Qt 6.8 解析模块导入时落盘，全库 90+ 文件）——纯运行时产物。
*.qmlc
!dist/to-do-list.txt
!dist/apple-submission-reply.txt
!dist/in-app-purchase-html2txt.txt
*.log
# 5WHY: `build-*/` above (for local CMake dirs like build-test/) would also
# match the composite actions named build-*.  Re-include them — they are
# tracked source, not build output.
!.github/actions/build-*/
# IDE / tools
.claude/
.codewhale/
.deepseek/
.vscode/

# Certificates & signing (sensitive)
resources/cert/
!resources/cert/README.md

# Global sensitive-file patterns — never commit signing material or secrets
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
*.pem
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.cer
*.csr
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*_rsa
*_ed25519

# Generated from .in template by CMake / CI — team ID injected at build time
resources/apple/macos.entitlements

# Docs — only privacy-policy.html is public
docs/*
!docs/privacy-policy.html

# Temp files
crashes/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
# 5WHY: `scripts/` (dir pattern) blocks ALL file-level negations below —
# a negated path can't re-include a file inside an excluded directory.
# `scripts/*` ignores the contents but keeps the dir itself visible, so the
# `!scripts/...` whitelist entries work for NEW files (not just pre-tracked).
scripts/*
!scripts/screenshot/
!scripts/ios/
!scripts/installer/
!scripts/pre-commit
!scripts/palette_common.py
!scripts/ci-http-server.py
!scripts/install-hooks
!scripts/generate-screenshots.py
!scripts/generate-phone-screenshots.py
!scripts/generate-pad-screenshots.py
!scripts/generate-colored-icons.py
!scripts/generate-appcolors.py
!scripts/audit-palette-contrast.py
# 5WHY (review 2026-08-17): review/（目录模式）使目录内文件的否定白名单对
# 新文件失效——改为 review/* + 显式白名单（同 scripts/* 约定）；本地临时
# 产物继续显式忽略。
review/*
!review/ios-startup-crash-5why-analysis.md
!review/ios-ci-known-issues.md
!review/app_startup_crash_analysis.md
!review/common-bug-patterns.md
!review/icon-audit-45-2026-08-14.md
!review/code-review-2026-08-17.md
review/theme-contrast-audit.md
review/design-tools/
review/history/
review/icons/
review/refactor/
review/*.png
review/*.log
review/tmp-*
review/refactor-review-findings.md
review/living-diagnostics-plan-v3.md
review/living-diagnostics-implementation-v4.md
review/icon-comparison-2026-08-14.html

# CodeWhale config — only constitution.json is shared
**/.codewhale/*
!**/.codewhale/constitution.json

# Internal documentation (not for public)
resources/doc/PROJECT_CHANGES.md
resources/doc/design-spec.html
resources/doc/design-tokens.json

# Stale CI screenshots (pipeline removed)
resources/doc/screenshot/android/
